Backport of https://github.com/hermeticbuild/hermetic-llvm/pull/963 (head 84bf721)
to hermetic-llvm 0.8.27: compiles executing on a Windows host use param files
whatever OS they target. The e2e/ and CI changes are omitted (not in the
release archive), and the clang_cl hunks are adapted to 0.8.27, which
predates the compiler_param_file_on_demand feature.

